	<section aria-labelledby="terms-use"><h2 id="terms-use" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Acceptable use</h2><p class="mt-2">Use the converter only with images you have the right to use. Do not use the website to violate another person’s rights, break the law, interfere with the service, or attempt to compromise its security.</p></section>
