	<section aria-labelledby="terms-ip"><h2 id="terms-ip" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Intellectual property</h2><p class="mt-2">The website’s name, interface, and original site content belong to their respective rights holders. You retain your rights to your images and the content you create with them.</p></section>
