	<section aria-labelledby="terms-changes"><h2 id="terms-changes" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Changes to the service or terms</h2><p class="mt-2">The service and these terms may change as the website develops. The current version will be published on this page. Continuing to use the website after a change means you accept the updated terms where applicable.</p></section>
</ContentPage>
